{"id":26,"name":"الشعراء","transliteration":"Ash-Shu'ara","translation_fr":"Les poètes","translation_en":"The Poets","type":"meccan","total_verses":227,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"طسٓمٓ","translation_fr":"T'â, Sîn, Mim","translation_en":"Ta, Seen, Meem","transliteration":"Taseenmeem"},{"id":2,"text":"تِلۡكَ ءَايَٰتُ ٱلۡكِتَٰبِ ٱلۡمُبِينِ","translation_fr":"Voici les versets du Livre explicite","translation_en":"These are the verses of the clear Book","transliteration":"Tilka ayatu alkitabi almubeeni"},{"id":3,"text":"لَعَلَّكَ بَٰخِعٞ نَّفۡسَكَ أَلَّا يَكُونُواْ مُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Il se peut que tu te consumes de chagrin parce qu'ils ne sont pas croyants","translation_en":"Perhaps, [O Muhammad], you would kill yourself with grief that they will not be believers","transliteration":"LaAAallaka bakhiAAun nafsaka alla yakoonoo mumineena"},{"id":4,"text":"إِن نَّشَأۡ نُنَزِّلۡ عَلَيۡهِم مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ ءَايَةٗ فَظَلَّتۡ أَعۡنَٰقُهُمۡ لَهَا خَٰضِعِينَ","translation_fr":"Si Nous voulions, Nous ferions descendre du ciel sur eux un prodige devant lequel leurs nuques resteront courbées","translation_en":"If We willed, We could send down to them from the sky a sign for which their necks would remain humbled","transliteration":"In nasha nunazzil AAalayhim mina alssamai ayatan fathallat aAAnaquhum laha khadiAAeena"},{"id":5,"text":"وَمَا يَأۡتِيهِم مِّن ذِكۡرٖ مِّنَ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِ مُحۡدَثٍ إِلَّا كَانُواْ عَنۡهُ مُعۡرِضِينَ","translation_fr":"Aucun nouveau rappel ne leur vient du Tout Miséricordieux sans qu'ils ne l'esquivent","translation_en":"And no revelation comes to them anew from the Most Merciful except that they turn away from it","transliteration":"Wama yateehim min thikrin mina alrrahmani muhdathin illa kanoo AAanhu muAArideena"},{"id":6,"text":"فَقَدۡ كَذَّبُواْ فَسَيَأۡتِيهِمۡ أَنۢبَـٰٓؤُاْ مَا كَانُواْ بِهِۦ يَسۡتَهۡزِءُونَ","translation_fr":"Et ils ont traité de mensonge [tout ce qui leur vient du Seigneur]. Il leur viendra bientôt des nouvelles de ce dont ils se raillent","translation_en":"For they have already denied, but there will come to them the news of that which they used to ridicule","transliteration":"Faqad kaththaboo fasayateehim anbao ma kanoo bihi yastahzioona"},{"id":7,"text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَرَوۡاْ إِلَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ كَمۡ أَنۢبَتۡنَا فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ زَوۡجٖ كَرِيمٍ","translation_fr":"N'ont-ils pas observé la terre, combien Nous y avons fait pousser de couples généreux de toutes sortes","translation_en":"Did they not look at the earth - how much We have produced therein from every noble kind","transliteration":"Awalam yaraw ila alardi kam anbatna feeha min kulli zawjin kareemin"},{"id":8,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà bien là une preuve! Et la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":9,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et ton Seigneur est en vérité Lui le Tout Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":10,"text":"وَإِذۡ نَادَىٰ رَبُّكَ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنِ ٱئۡتِ ٱلۡقَوۡمَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","translation_fr":"Et lorsque ton Seigneur appela Moïse: «Rends-toi auprès du peuple injuste","translation_en":"And [mention] when your Lord called Moses, [saying], \"Go to the wrongdoing people","transliteration":"Waith nada rabbuka moosa ani iti alqawma alththalimeena"},{"id":11,"text":"قَوۡمَ فِرۡعَوۡنَۚ أَلَا يَتَّقُونَ","translation_fr":"[auprès du] peuple de Pharaon» ne craindront-ils pas (Allah)","translation_en":"The people of Pharaoh. Will they not fear Allah","transliteration":"Qawma firAAawna ala yattaqoona"},{"id":12,"text":"قَالَ رَبِّ إِنِّيٓ أَخَافُ أَن يُكَذِّبُونِ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Seigneur, je crains qu'ils ne me traitent de menteur","translation_en":"He said, \"My Lord, indeed I fear that they will deny me","transliteration":"Qala rabbi innee akhafu an yukaththibooni"},{"id":13,"text":"وَيَضِيقُ صَدۡرِي وَلَا يَنطَلِقُ لِسَانِي فَأَرۡسِلۡ إِلَىٰ هَٰرُونَ","translation_fr":"que ma poitrine ne se serre, et que ma langue ne soit embarrassée: Mande donc Aaron","translation_en":"And that my breast will tighten and my tongue will not be fluent, so send for Aaron","transliteration":"Wayadeequ sadree wala yantaliqu lisanee faarsil ila haroona"},{"id":14,"text":"وَلَهُمۡ عَلَيَّ ذَنۢبٞ فَأَخَافُ أَن يَقۡتُلُونِ","translation_fr":"Ils ont un crime à me reprocher; je crains donc qu'ils ne me tuent»","translation_en":"And they have upon me a [claim due to] sin, so I fear that they will kill me","transliteration":"Walahum AAalayya thanbun faakhafu an yaqtulooni"},{"id":15,"text":"قَالَ كَلَّاۖ فَٱذۡهَبَا بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآۖ إِنَّا مَعَكُم مُّسۡتَمِعُونَ","translation_fr":"Mais [Allah lui] dit: «Jamais! Allez tous deux avec Nos prodiges, Nous resterons avec vous et Nous écouterons","translation_en":"[Allah] said, \"No. Go both of you with Our signs; indeed, We are with you, listening","transliteration":"Qala kalla faithhaba biayatina inna maAAakum mustamiAAoona"},{"id":16,"text":"فَأۡتِيَا فِرۡعَوۡنَ فَقُولَآ إِنَّا رَسُولُ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Rendez-vous donc tous deux auprès de Pharaon, puis dites: «Nous sommes les messagers du Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"Go to Pharaoh and say, 'We are the messengers of the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Fatiya firAAawna faqoola inna rasoolu rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":17,"text":"أَنۡ أَرۡسِلۡ مَعَنَا بَنِيٓ إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ","translation_fr":"pour que tu renvoies les Enfants d'Israël avec nous»","translation_en":"[Commanded to say], \"Send with us the Children of Israel","transliteration":"An arsil maAAana banee israeela"},{"id":18,"text":"قَالَ أَلَمۡ نُرَبِّكَ فِينَا وَلِيدٗا وَلَبِثۡتَ فِينَا مِنۡ عُمُرِكَ سِنِينَ","translation_fr":"«Ne t'avons-nous pas, dit Pharaon, élevé chez nous tout enfant? Et n'as-tu pas demeuré parmi nous des années de ta vie","translation_en":"[Pharaoh] said, \"Did we not raise you among us as a child, and you remained among us for years of your life","transliteration":"Qala alam nurabbika feena waleedan walabithta feena min AAumurika sineena"},{"id":19,"text":"وَفَعَلۡتَ فَعۡلَتَكَ ٱلَّتِي فَعَلۡتَ وَأَنتَ مِنَ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Puis tu as commis le méfait que tu as fait, en dépit de toute reconnaissance»","translation_en":"And [then] you did your deed which you did, and you were of the ungrateful","transliteration":"WafaAAalta faAAlataka allatee faAAalta waanta mina alkafireena"},{"id":20,"text":"قَالَ فَعَلۡتُهَآ إِذٗا وَأَنَا۠ مِنَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","translation_fr":"«Je l'ai fait, dit Moïse, alors que j'étais encore du nombre des égarés","translation_en":"[Moses] said, \"I did it, then, while I was of those astray","transliteration":"Qala faAAaltuha ithan waana mina alddalleena"},{"id":21,"text":"فَفَرَرۡتُ مِنكُمۡ لَمَّا خِفۡتُكُمۡ فَوَهَبَ لِي رَبِّي حُكۡمٗا وَجَعَلَنِي مِنَ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","translation_fr":"Je me suis donc enfui de vous quand j'ai eu peur de vous: puis, mon Seigneur m'a donné la sagesse et m'a désigné parmi Ses messagers","translation_en":"So I fled from you when I feared you. Then my Lord granted me wisdom and prophethood and appointed me [as one] of the messengers","transliteration":"Fafarartu minkum lamma khiftukum fawahaba lee rabbee hukman wajaAAalanee mina almursaleena"},{"id":22,"text":"وَتِلۡكَ نِعۡمَةٞ تَمُنُّهَا عَلَيَّ أَنۡ عَبَّدتَّ بَنِيٓ إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ","translation_fr":"Est-ce là un bienfait de ta part [que tu me rappelles] avec reproche, alors que tu as asservi les Enfants d'Israël?»","translation_en":"And is this a favor of which you remind me - that you have enslaved the Children of Israel","transliteration":"Watilka niAAmatun tamunnuha AAalayya an AAabbadta banee israeela"},{"id":23,"text":"قَالَ فِرۡعَوۡنُ وَمَا رَبُّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"«Et qu'est-ce que le Seigneur de l'univers?» dit Pharaon","translation_en":"Said Pharaoh, \"And what is the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Qala firAAawnu wama rabbu alAAalameena"},{"id":24,"text":"قَالَ رَبُّ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَآۖ إِن كُنتُم مُّوقِنِينَ","translation_fr":"«Le Seigneur des cieux et de la terre et de ce qui existe entre eux, dit [Moïse], si seulement vous pouviez en être convaincus!»","translation_en":"[Moses] said, \"The Lord of the heavens and earth and that between them, if you should be convinced","transliteration":"Qala rabbu alssamawati waalardi wama baynahuma in kuntum mooqineena"},{"id":25,"text":"قَالَ لِمَنۡ حَوۡلَهُۥٓ أَلَا تَسۡتَمِعُونَ","translation_fr":"[Pharaon] dit à ceux qui l'entouraient: «N'entendez-vous pas","translation_en":"[Pharaoh] said to those around him, \"Do you not hear","transliteration":"Qala liman hawlahu ala tastamiAAoona"},{"id":26,"text":"قَالَ رَبُّكُمۡ وَرَبُّ ءَابَآئِكُمُ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"[Moïse] continue: «... Votre Seigneur, et le Seigneur de vos plus anciens ancêtres»","translation_en":"[Moses] said, \"Your Lord and the Lord of your first forefathers","transliteration":"Qala rabbukum warabbu abaikumu alawwaleena"},{"id":27,"text":"قَالَ إِنَّ رَسُولَكُمُ ٱلَّذِيٓ أُرۡسِلَ إِلَيۡكُمۡ لَمَجۡنُونٞ","translation_fr":"«Vraiment, dit [Pharaon], votre messager qui vous a été envoyé, est un fou»","translation_en":"[Pharaoh] said, \"Indeed, your 'messenger' who has been sent to you is mad","transliteration":"Qala inna rasoolakumu allathee orsila ilaykum lamajnoonun"},{"id":28,"text":"قَالَ رَبُّ ٱلۡمَشۡرِقِ وَٱلۡمَغۡرِبِ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَآۖ إِن كُنتُمۡ تَعۡقِلُونَ","translation_fr":"[Moïse] ajouta: «... Le Seigneur du Levant et du Couchant et de ce qui est entre les deux; si seulement vous compreniez!»","translation_en":"[Moses] said, \"Lord of the east and the west and that between them, if you were to reason","transliteration":"Qala rabbu almashriqi waalmaghribi wama baynahuma in kuntum taAAqiloona"},{"id":29,"text":"قَالَ لَئِنِ ٱتَّخَذۡتَ إِلَٰهًا غَيۡرِي لَأَجۡعَلَنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلۡمَسۡجُونِينَ","translation_fr":"«Si tu adoptes, dit [Pharaon], une autre divinité que moi, je te mettrai parmi les prisonniers»","translation_en":"[Pharaoh] said, \"If you take a god other than me, I will surely place you among those imprisoned","transliteration":"Qala laini ittakhathta ilahan ghayree laajAAalannaka mina almasjooneena"},{"id":30,"text":"قَالَ أَوَلَوۡ جِئۡتُكَ بِشَيۡءٖ مُّبِينٖ","translation_fr":"«Et même si je t'apportais, dit [Moïse], une chose (une preuve) évidente","translation_en":"[Moses] said, \"Even if I brought you proof manifest","transliteration":"Qala awalaw jituka bishayin mubeenin"},{"id":31,"text":"قَالَ فَأۡتِ بِهِۦٓ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","translation_fr":"«Apporte-la, dit [Pharaon], si tu es du nombre des véridiques»","translation_en":"[Pharaoh] said, \"Then bring it, if you should be of the truthful","transliteration":"Qala fati bihi in kunta mina alssadiqeena"},{"id":32,"text":"فَأَلۡقَىٰ عَصَاهُ فَإِذَا هِيَ ثُعۡبَانٞ مُّبِينٞ","translation_fr":"[Moïse] jeta donc son bâton et le voilà devenu un serpent manifeste","translation_en":"So [Moses] threw his staff, and suddenly it was a serpent manifest","transliteration":"Faalqa AAasahu faitha hiya thuAAbanun mubeenun"},{"id":33,"text":"وَنَزَعَ يَدَهُۥ فَإِذَا هِيَ بَيۡضَآءُ لِلنَّـٰظِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Et il tira sa main et voilà qu'elle était blanche (étincelante) à ceux qui regardaient","translation_en":"And he drew out his hand; thereupon it was white for the observers","transliteration":"WanazaAAa yadahu faitha hiya baydao lilnnathireena"},{"id":34,"text":"قَالَ لِلۡمَلَإِ حَوۡلَهُۥٓ إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَسَٰحِرٌ عَلِيمٞ","translation_fr":"[Pharaon] dit aux notables autour de lui: «Voilà en vérité un magicien savant","translation_en":"[Pharaoh] said to the eminent ones around him, \"Indeed, this is a learned magician","transliteration":"Qala lilmalai hawlahu inna hatha lasahirun AAaleemun"},{"id":35,"text":"يُرِيدُ أَن يُخۡرِجَكُم مِّنۡ أَرۡضِكُم بِسِحۡرِهِۦ فَمَاذَا تَأۡمُرُونَ","translation_fr":"Il veut par sa magie vous expulser de votre terre. Que commandez-vous?»","translation_en":"He wants to drive you out of your land by his magic, so what do you advise","transliteration":"Yureedu an yukhrijakum min ardikum bisihrihi famatha tamuroona"},{"id":36,"text":"قَالُوٓاْ أَرۡجِهۡ وَأَخَاهُ وَٱبۡعَثۡ فِي ٱلۡمَدَآئِنِ حَٰشِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Remets-les à plus tard, [lui] et son frère, et envoie des gens dans les villes, pour rassembler","translation_en":"They said, \"Postpone [the matter of] him and his brother and send among the cities gatherers","transliteration":"Qaloo arjih waakhahu waibAAath fee almadaini hashireena"},{"id":37,"text":"يَأۡتُوكَ بِكُلِّ سَحَّارٍ عَلِيمٖ","translation_fr":"et t'amener tout grand magicien savant»","translation_en":"Who will bring you every learned, skilled magician","transliteration":"Yatooka bikulli sahharin AAaleemin"},{"id":38,"text":"فَجُمِعَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ لِمِيقَٰتِ يَوۡمٖ مَّعۡلُومٖ","translation_fr":"Les magiciens furent donc réunis en rendez-vous au jour convenu","translation_en":"So the magicians were assembled for the appointment of a well-known day","transliteration":"FajumiAAa alssaharatu limeeqati yawmin maAAloomin"},{"id":39,"text":"وَقِيلَ لِلنَّاسِ هَلۡ أَنتُم مُّجۡتَمِعُونَ","translation_fr":"Et il fut dit aux gens: «Est-ce que vous allez vous réunir","translation_en":"And it was said to the people, \"Will you congregate","transliteration":"Waqeela lilnnasi hal antum mujtamiAAoona"},{"id":40,"text":"لَعَلَّنَا نَتَّبِعُ ٱلسَّحَرَةَ إِن كَانُواْ هُمُ ٱلۡغَٰلِبِينَ","translation_fr":"afin que nous suivions les magiciens, si ce sont eux les vainqueurs?»","translation_en":"That we might follow the magicians if they are the predominant","transliteration":"LaAAallana nattabiAAu alssaharata in kanoo humu alghalibeena"},{"id":41,"text":"فَلَمَّا جَآءَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ قَالُواْ لِفِرۡعَوۡنَ أَئِنَّ لَنَا لَأَجۡرًا إِن كُنَّا نَحۡنُ ٱلۡغَٰلِبِينَ","translation_fr":"Puis, lorsque les magiciens arrivèrent, ils dirent à Pharaon: «Y aura-t-il vraiment une récompense pour nous, si nous sommes les vainqueurs?»","translation_en":"And when the magicians arrived, they said to Pharaoh, \"Is there indeed for us a reward if we are the predominant","transliteration":"Falamma jaa alssaharatu qaloo lifirAAawna ainna lana laajran in kunna nahnu alghalibeena"},{"id":42,"text":"قَالَ نَعَمۡ وَإِنَّكُمۡ إِذٗا لَّمِنَ ٱلۡمُقَرَّبِينَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Oui, bien sûr, vous serez alors parmi mes proches!»","translation_en":"He said, \"Yes, and indeed, you will then be of those near [to me]","transliteration":"Qala naAAam wainnakum ithan lamina almuqarrabeena"},{"id":43,"text":"قَالَ لَهُم مُّوسَىٰٓ أَلۡقُواْ مَآ أَنتُم مُّلۡقُونَ","translation_fr":"Moïse leur dit: «Jetez ce que vous avez à jeter»","translation_en":"Moses said to them, \"Throw whatever you will throw","transliteration":"Qala lahum moosa alqoo ma antum mulqoona"},{"id":44,"text":"فَأَلۡقَوۡاْ حِبَالَهُمۡ وَعِصِيَّهُمۡ وَقَالُواْ بِعِزَّةِ فِرۡعَوۡنَ إِنَّا لَنَحۡنُ ٱلۡغَٰلِبُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils jetèrent donc leurs cordes et leurs bâtons et dirent: «Par la puissance de Pharaon!... C'est nous qui serons les vainqueurs»","translation_en":"So they threw their ropes and their staffs and said, \"By the might of Pharaoh, indeed it is we who are predominant","transliteration":"Faalqaw hibalahum waAAisiyyahum waqaloo biAAizzati firAAawna inna lanahnu alghaliboona"},{"id":45,"text":"فَأَلۡقَىٰ مُوسَىٰ عَصَاهُ فَإِذَا هِيَ تَلۡقَفُ مَا يَأۡفِكُونَ","translation_fr":"Puis Moïse jeta son bâton, et voilà qu'il happait ce qu'ils avaient fabriqué","translation_en":"Then Moses threw his staff, and at once it devoured what they falsified","transliteration":"Faalqa moosa AAasahu faitha hiya talqafu ma yafikoona"},{"id":46,"text":"فَأُلۡقِيَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ سَٰجِدِينَ","translation_fr":"Alors les magiciens tombèrent prosternés","translation_en":"So the magicians fell down in prostration [to Allah]","transliteration":"Faolqiya alssaharatu sajideena"},{"id":47,"text":"قَالُوٓاْ ءَامَنَّا بِرَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"disant: «Nous croyons au Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"They said, \"We have believed in the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Qaloo amanna birabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":48,"text":"رَبِّ مُوسَىٰ وَهَٰرُونَ","translation_fr":"Le Seigneur de Moïse et d'Aaron»","translation_en":"The Lord of Moses and Aaron","transliteration":"Rabbi moosa waharoona"},{"id":49,"text":"قَالَ ءَامَنتُمۡ لَهُۥ قَبۡلَ أَنۡ ءَاذَنَ لَكُمۡۖ إِنَّهُۥ لَكَبِيرُكُمُ ٱلَّذِي عَلَّمَكُمُ ٱلسِّحۡرَ فَلَسَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَۚ لَأُقَطِّعَنَّ أَيۡدِيَكُمۡ وَأَرۡجُلَكُم مِّنۡ خِلَٰفٖ وَلَأُصَلِّبَنَّكُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","translation_fr":"[Pharaon] dit: «Avez-vous cru en lui avant que je ne vous le permette? En vérité, c'est lui votre chef, qui vous a enseigné la magie! Eh bien, vous saurez bientôt! Je vous couperai, sûrement, mains et jambes opposées, et vous crucifierai tous»","translation_en":"[Pharaoh] said, \"You believed Moses before I gave you permission. Indeed, he is your leader who has taught you magic, but you are going to know. I will surely cut off your hands and your feet on opposite sides, and I will surely crucify you all","transliteration":"Qala amantum lahu qabla an athana lakum innahu lakabeerukumu allathee AAallamakumu alssihra falasawfa taAAlamoona laoqattiAAanna aydiyakum waarjulakum min khilafin walaosallibannakum ajmaAAeena"},{"id":50,"text":"قَالُواْ لَا ضَيۡرَۖ إِنَّآ إِلَىٰ رَبِّنَا مُنقَلِبُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils disent: «Il n'y a pas de mal! Car c'est vers notre Seigneur que nous retournerons","translation_en":"They said, \"No harm. Indeed, to our Lord we will return","transliteration":"Qaloo la dayra inna ila rabbina munqaliboona"},{"id":51,"text":"إِنَّا نَطۡمَعُ أَن يَغۡفِرَ لَنَا رَبُّنَا خَطَٰيَٰنَآ أَن كُنَّآ أَوَّلَ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous convoitons que notre Seigneur nous pardonne nos fautes pour avoir été les premiers à croire»","translation_en":"Indeed, we aspire that our Lord will forgive us our sins because we were the first of the believers","transliteration":"Inna natmaAAu an yaghfira lana rabbuna khatayana an kunna awwala almumineena"},{"id":52,"text":"۞وَأَوۡحَيۡنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنۡ أَسۡرِ بِعِبَادِيٓ إِنَّكُم مُّتَّبَعُونَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous révélâmes à Moïse [ceci]: «Pars de nuit avec Mes serviteurs, car vous serez poursuivis»","translation_en":"And We inspired to Moses, \"Travel by night with My servants; indeed, you will be pursued","transliteration":"Waawhayna ila moosa an asri biAAibadee innakum muttabaAAoona"},{"id":53,"text":"فَأَرۡسَلَ فِرۡعَوۡنُ فِي ٱلۡمَدَآئِنِ حَٰشِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Puis, Pharaon envoya des rassembleurs [dire] dans les villes","translation_en":"Then Pharaoh sent among the cities gatherers","transliteration":"Faarsala firAAawnu fee almadaini hashireena"},{"id":54,"text":"إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ لَشِرۡذِمَةٞ قَلِيلُونَ","translation_fr":"«Ce sont, en fait, une bande peu nombreuse","translation_en":"[And said], \"Indeed, those are but a small band","transliteration":"Inna haolai lashirthimatun qaleeloona"},{"id":55,"text":"وَإِنَّهُمۡ لَنَا لَغَآئِظُونَ","translation_fr":"mais ils nous irritent","translation_en":"And indeed, they are enraging us","transliteration":"Wainnahum lana laghaithoona"},{"id":56,"text":"وَإِنَّا لَجَمِيعٌ حَٰذِرُونَ","translation_fr":"tandis que nous sommes tous vigilants»","translation_en":"And indeed, we are a cautious society","transliteration":"Wainna lajameeAAun hathiroona"},{"id":57,"text":"فَأَخۡرَجۡنَٰهُم مِّن جَنَّـٰتٖ وَعُيُونٖ","translation_fr":"Ainsi, Nous les fîmes donc sortir des jardins, des sources","translation_en":"So We removed them from gardens and springs","transliteration":"Faakhrajnahum min jannatin waAAuyoonin"},{"id":58,"text":"وَكُنُوزٖ وَمَقَامٖ كَرِيمٖ","translation_fr":"des trésors et d'un lieu de séjour agréable","translation_en":"And treasures and honorable station","transliteration":"Wakunoozin wamaqamin kareemin"},{"id":59,"text":"كَذَٰلِكَۖ وَأَوۡرَثۡنَٰهَا بَنِيٓ إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ","translation_fr":"Il en fut ainsi! Et Nous les donnâmes en héritage aux enfants d'Israël","translation_en":"Thus. And We caused to inherit it the Children of Israel","transliteration":"Kathalika waawrathnaha banee israeela"},{"id":60,"text":"فَأَتۡبَعُوهُم مُّشۡرِقِينَ","translation_fr":"Au lever du soleil, ils les poursuivirent","translation_en":"So they pursued them at sunrise","transliteration":"FaatbaAAoohum mushriqeena"},{"id":61,"text":"فَلَمَّا تَرَـٰٓءَا ٱلۡجَمۡعَانِ قَالَ أَصۡحَٰبُ مُوسَىٰٓ إِنَّا لَمُدۡرَكُونَ","translation_fr":"Puis, quand les deux partis se virent, les compagnons de Moïse dirent: «Nous allons être rejoints»","translation_en":"And when the two companies saw one another, the companions of Moses said, \"Indeed, we are to be overtaken","transliteration":"Falamma taraa aljamAAani qala ashabu moosa inna lamudrakoona"},{"id":62,"text":"قَالَ كَلَّآۖ إِنَّ مَعِيَ رَبِّي سَيَهۡدِينِ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Jamais, car j'ai avec moi mon Seigneur qui va me guider»","translation_en":"[Moses] said, \"No! Indeed, with me is my Lord; He will guide me","transliteration":"Qala kalla inna maAAiya rabbee sayahdeeni"},{"id":63,"text":"فَأَوۡحَيۡنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنِ ٱضۡرِب بِّعَصَاكَ ٱلۡبَحۡرَۖ فَٱنفَلَقَ فَكَانَ كُلُّ فِرۡقٖ كَٱلطَّوۡدِ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","translation_fr":"Alors Nous révélâmes à Moïse: «Frappe la mer de ton bâton». Elle se fendit alors, et chaque versant fut comme une énorme montagne","translation_en":"Then We inspired to Moses, \"Strike with your staff the sea,\" and it parted, and each portion was like a great towering mountain","transliteration":"Faawhayna ila moosa ani idrib biAAasaka albahra fainfalaqa fakana kullu firqin kaalttawdi alAAatheemi"},{"id":64,"text":"وَأَزۡلَفۡنَا ثَمَّ ٱلۡأٓخَرِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous fîmes approcher les autres [Pharaon et son peuple]","translation_en":"And We advanced thereto the pursuers","transliteration":"Waazlafna thamma alakhareena"},{"id":65,"text":"وَأَنجَيۡنَا مُوسَىٰ وَمَن مَّعَهُۥٓ أَجۡمَعِينَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous sauvâmes Moïse et tous ceux qui étaient avec lui","translation_en":"And We saved Moses and those with him, all together","transliteration":"Waanjayna moosa waman maAAahu ajmaAAeena"},{"id":66,"text":"ثُمَّ أَغۡرَقۡنَا ٱلۡأٓخَرِينَ","translation_fr":"ensuite Nous noyâmes les autres","translation_en":"Then We drowned the others","transliteration":"Thumma aghraqna alakhareena"},{"id":67,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà bien là un prodige, mais la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":68,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et ton Seigneur, c'est en vérité Lui le Tout Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":69,"text":"وَٱتۡلُ عَلَيۡهِمۡ نَبَأَ إِبۡرَٰهِيمَ","translation_fr":"Et récite-leur la nouvelle d'Abraham","translation_en":"And recite to them the news of Abraham","transliteration":"Waotlu AAalayhim nabaa ibraheema"},{"id":70,"text":"إِذۡ قَالَ لِأَبِيهِ وَقَوۡمِهِۦ مَا تَعۡبُدُونَ","translation_fr":"Quand il dit à son père et à son peuple: «Qu'adorez-vous?»","translation_en":"When he said to his father and his people, \"What do you worship","transliteration":"Ith qala liabeehi waqawmihi ma taAAbudoona"},{"id":71,"text":"قَالُواْ نَعۡبُدُ أَصۡنَامٗا فَنَظَلُّ لَهَا عَٰكِفِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Nous adorons des idoles et nous leurs restons attachés»","translation_en":"They said, \"We worship idols and remain to them devoted","transliteration":"Qaloo naAAbudu asnaman fanathallu laha AAakifeena"},{"id":72,"text":"قَالَ هَلۡ يَسۡمَعُونَكُمۡ إِذۡ تَدۡعُونَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Vous entendent-elles lorsque vous [les] appelez","translation_en":"He said, \"Do they hear you when you supplicate","transliteration":"Qala hal yasmaAAoonakum ith tadAAoona"},{"id":73,"text":"أَوۡ يَنفَعُونَكُمۡ أَوۡ يَضُرُّونَ","translation_fr":"ou vous profitent-elles? ou vous nuisent-elles?»","translation_en":"Or do they benefit you, or do they harm","transliteration":"Aw yanfaAAoonakum aw yadurroona"},{"id":74,"text":"قَالُواْ بَلۡ وَجَدۡنَآ ءَابَآءَنَا كَذَٰلِكَ يَفۡعَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Non! mais nous avons trouvé nos ancêtres agissant ainsi»","translation_en":"They said, \"But we found our fathers doing thus","transliteration":"Qaloo bal wajadna abaana kathalika yafAAaloona"},{"id":75,"text":"قَالَ أَفَرَءَيۡتُم مَّا كُنتُمۡ تَعۡبُدُونَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Que dites-vous de ce que vous adoriez","translation_en":"He said, \"Then do you see what you have been worshipping","transliteration":"Qala afaraaytum ma kuntum taAAbudoona"},{"id":76,"text":"أَنتُمۡ وَءَابَآؤُكُمُ ٱلۡأَقۡدَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Vous et vos vieux ancêtres","translation_en":"You and your ancient forefathers","transliteration":"Antum waabaokumu alaqdamoona"},{"id":77,"text":"فَإِنَّهُمۡ عَدُوّٞ لِّيٓ إِلَّا رَبَّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils sont tous pour moi des ennemis sauf le Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"Indeed, they are enemies to me, except the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Fainnahum AAaduwwun lee illa rabba alAAalameena"},{"id":78,"text":"ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَنِي فَهُوَ يَهۡدِينِ","translation_fr":"qui m'a créé, et c'est Lui qui me guide","translation_en":"Who created me, and He [it is who] guides me","transliteration":"Allathee khalaqanee fahuwa yahdeeni"},{"id":79,"text":"وَٱلَّذِي هُوَ يُطۡعِمُنِي وَيَسۡقِينِ","translation_fr":"et c'est Lui qui me nourrit et me donne à boire","translation_en":"And it is He who feeds me and gives me drink","transliteration":"Waallathee huwa yutAAimunee wayasqeeni"},{"id":80,"text":"وَإِذَا مَرِضۡتُ فَهُوَ يَشۡفِينِ","translation_fr":"et quand je suis malade, c'est Lui qui me guérit","translation_en":"And when I am ill, it is He who cures me","transliteration":"Waitha maridtu fahuwa yashfeeni"},{"id":81,"text":"وَٱلَّذِي يُمِيتُنِي ثُمَّ يُحۡيِينِ","translation_fr":"et qui me fera mourir, puis me redonnera la vie","translation_en":"And who will cause me to die and then bring me to life","transliteration":"Waallathee yumeetunee thumma yuhyeeni"},{"id":82,"text":"وَٱلَّذِيٓ أَطۡمَعُ أَن يَغۡفِرَ لِي خَطِيٓـَٔتِي يَوۡمَ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"et c'est de Lui que je convoite le pardon de mes fautes le Jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"And who I aspire that He will forgive me my sin on the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Waallathee atmaAAu an yaghfira lee khateeatee yawma alddeeni"},{"id":83,"text":"رَبِّ هَبۡ لِي حُكۡمٗا وَأَلۡحِقۡنِي بِٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","translation_fr":"Seigneur, accorde-moi sagesse (et savoir) et fais-moi rejoindre les gens de bien","translation_en":"[And he said], \"My Lord, grant me authority and join me with the righteous","transliteration":"Rabbi hab lee hukman waalhiqnee bialssaliheena"},{"id":84,"text":"وَٱجۡعَل لِّي لِسَانَ صِدۡقٖ فِي ٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","translation_fr":"fais que j'aie une mention honorable sur les langues de la postérité","translation_en":"And grant me a reputation of honor among later generations","transliteration":"WaijAAal lee lisana sidqin fee alakhireena"},{"id":85,"text":"وَٱجۡعَلۡنِي مِن وَرَثَةِ جَنَّةِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","translation_fr":"et fais de moi l'un des héritiers du Jardin des délices","translation_en":"And place me among the inheritors of the Garden of Pleasure","transliteration":"WaijAAalnee min warathati jannati alnnaAAeemi"},{"id":86,"text":"وَٱغۡفِرۡ لِأَبِيٓ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ مِنَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","translation_fr":"et pardonne à mon père: car il a été du nombre des égarés","translation_en":"And forgive my father. Indeed, he has been of those astray","transliteration":"Waighfir liabee innahu kana mina alddalleena"},{"id":87,"text":"وَلَا تُخۡزِنِي يَوۡمَ يُبۡعَثُونَ","translation_fr":"et ne me couvre pas d'ignominie, le jour où l'on sera ressuscité","translation_en":"And do not disgrace me on the Day they are [all] resurrected","transliteration":"Wala tukhzinee yawma yubAAathoona"},{"id":88,"text":"يَوۡمَ لَا يَنفَعُ مَالٞ وَلَا بَنُونَ","translation_fr":"le jour où ni les biens, ni les enfants ne seront d'aucune utilité","translation_en":"The Day when there will not benefit [anyone] wealth or children","transliteration":"Yawma la yanfaAAu malun wala banoona"},{"id":89,"text":"إِلَّا مَنۡ أَتَى ٱللَّهَ بِقَلۡبٖ سَلِيمٖ","translation_fr":"sauf celui qui vient à Allah avec un cœur sain»","translation_en":"But only one who comes to Allah with a sound heart","transliteration":"Illa man ata Allaha biqalbin saleemin"},{"id":90,"text":"وَأُزۡلِفَتِ ٱلۡجَنَّةُ لِلۡمُتَّقِينَ","translation_fr":"On rapprochera alors le Paradis pour les pieux","translation_en":"And Paradise will be brought near [that Day] to the righteous","transliteration":"Waozlifati aljannatu lilmuttaqeena"},{"id":91,"text":"وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلۡجَحِيمُ لِلۡغَاوِينَ","translation_fr":"et l'on exposera aux errants la Fournaise","translation_en":"And Hellfire will be brought forth for the deviators","transliteration":"Waburrizati aljaheemu lilghaweena"},{"id":92,"text":"وَقِيلَ لَهُمۡ أَيۡنَ مَا كُنتُمۡ تَعۡبُدُونَ","translation_fr":"et on leur dira: «Où sont ceux que vous adoriez","translation_en":"And it will be said to them, \"Where are those you used to worship","transliteration":"Waqeela lahum ayna ma kuntum taAAbudoona"},{"id":93,"text":"مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ هَلۡ يَنصُرُونَكُمۡ أَوۡ يَنتَصِرُونَ","translation_fr":"en dehors d'Allah? vous secourent-ils? ou se secourent-ils eux-mêmes?»","translation_en":"Other than Allah? Can they help you or help themselves","transliteration":"Min dooni Allahi hal yansuroonakum aw yantasiroona"},{"id":94,"text":"فَكُبۡكِبُواْ فِيهَا هُمۡ وَٱلۡغَاوُۥنَ","translation_fr":"Ils y seront donc jetés pêle-mêle, et les errants aussi","translation_en":"So they will be overturned into Hellfire, they and the deviators","transliteration":"Fakubkiboo feeha hum waalghawoona"},{"id":95,"text":"وَجُنُودُ إِبۡلِيسَ أَجۡمَعُونَ","translation_fr":"ainsi que toutes les légions de Iblis","translation_en":"And the soldiers of Iblees, all together","transliteration":"Wajunoodu ibleesa ajmaAAoona"},{"id":96,"text":"قَالُواْ وَهُمۡ فِيهَا يَخۡتَصِمُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils diront, tout en s'y querellant","translation_en":"They will say while they dispute therein","transliteration":"Qaloo wahum feeha yakhtasimoona"},{"id":97,"text":"تَٱللَّهِ إِن كُنَّا لَفِي ضَلَٰلٖ مُّبِينٍ","translation_fr":"«Par Allah! Nous étions certes dans un égarement évident","translation_en":"By Allah, we were indeed in manifest error","transliteration":"TaAllahi in kunna lafee dalalin mubeenin"},{"id":98,"text":"إِذۡ نُسَوِّيكُم بِرَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"quand nous faisions de vous les égaux du Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"When we equated you with the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Ith nusawweekum birabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":99,"text":"وَمَآ أَضَلَّنَآ إِلَّا ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُونَ","translation_fr":"Ce ne sont que les criminels qui nous ont égarés","translation_en":"And no one misguided us except the criminals","transliteration":"Wama adallana illa almujrimoona"},{"id":100,"text":"فَمَا لَنَا مِن شَٰفِعِينَ","translation_fr":"Et nous n'avons pas d'intercesseurs","translation_en":"So now we have no intercessors","transliteration":"Fama lana min shafiAAeena"},{"id":101,"text":"وَلَا صَدِيقٍ حَمِيمٖ","translation_fr":"ni d'ami chaleureux","translation_en":"And not a devoted friend","transliteration":"Wala sadeeqin hameemin"},{"id":102,"text":"فَلَوۡ أَنَّ لَنَا كَرَّةٗ فَنَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Si un retour nous était possible, alors nous serions parmi les croyants!»","translation_en":"Then if we only had a return [to the world] and could be of the believers","transliteration":"Falaw anna lana karratan fanakoona mina almumineena"},{"id":103,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà bien là un signe; cependant, la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":104,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et ton Seigneur, c'est Lui vraiment le Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":105,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ قَوۡمُ نُوحٍ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","translation_fr":"Le peuple de Noé traita de menteurs les Messagers","translation_en":"The people of Noah denied the messengers","transliteration":"Kaththabat qawmu noohin almursaleena"},{"id":106,"text":"إِذۡ قَالَ لَهُمۡ أَخُوهُمۡ نُوحٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ","translation_fr":"lorsque Noé, leur frère, (contribule) leur dit: «Ne craindrez-vous pas [Allah]","translation_en":"When their brother Noah said to them, \"Will you not fear Allah","transliteration":"Ith qala lahum akhoohum noohun ala tattaqoona"},{"id":107,"text":"إِنِّي لَكُمۡ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٞ","translation_fr":"Je suis pour vous un messager digne de confiance","translation_en":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger","transliteration":"Innee lakum rasoolun ameenun"},{"id":108,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":109,"text":"وَمَآ أَسۡـَٔلُكُمۡ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۡ أَجۡرٍۖ إِنۡ أَجۡرِيَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Et je ne vous demande pas de salaire pour cela; mon salaire n'incombe qu'au Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Wama asalukum AAalayhi min ajrin in ajriya illa AAala rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":110,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc, et obéissez-moi»","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":111,"text":"۞قَالُوٓاْ أَنُؤۡمِنُ لَكَ وَٱتَّبَعَكَ ٱلۡأَرۡذَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Croirons-nous en toi, alors que ce sont les plus vils qui te suivent","translation_en":"They said, \"Should we believe you while you are followed by the lowest [class of people]","transliteration":"Qaloo anuminu laka waittabaAAaka alarthaloona"},{"id":112,"text":"قَالَ وَمَا عِلۡمِي بِمَا كَانُواْ يَعۡمَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Je ne sais pas ce que ceux-là faisaient","translation_en":"He said, \"And what is my knowledge of what they used to do","transliteration":"Qala wama AAilmee bima kanoo yaAAmaloona"},{"id":113,"text":"إِنۡ حِسَابُهُمۡ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّيۖ لَوۡ تَشۡعُرُونَ","translation_fr":"Leur compte n'incombe qu'à mon Seigneur. Si seulement vous êtes conscients","translation_en":"Their account is only upon my Lord, if you [could] perceive","transliteration":"In hisabuhum illa AAala rabbee law tashAAuroona"},{"id":114,"text":"وَمَآ أَنَا۠ بِطَارِدِ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Je ne suis pas celui qui repousse les croyants","translation_en":"And I am not one to drive away the believers","transliteration":"Wama ana bitaridi almumineena"},{"id":115,"text":"إِنۡ أَنَا۠ إِلَّا نَذِيرٞ مُّبِينٞ","translation_fr":"Je ne suis qu'un avertisseur explicite»","translation_en":"I am only a clear warner","transliteration":"In ana illa natheerun mubeenun"},{"id":116,"text":"قَالُواْ لَئِن لَّمۡ تَنتَهِ يَٰنُوحُ لَتَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلۡمَرۡجُومِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Si tu ne cesses pas, Noé, tu seras certainement du nombre des lapidés!»","translation_en":"They said, \"If you do not desist, O Noah, you will surely be of those who are stoned","transliteration":"Qaloo lain lam tantahi ya noohu latakoonanna mina almarjoomeena"},{"id":117,"text":"قَالَ رَبِّ إِنَّ قَوۡمِي كَذَّبُونِ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «O mon Seigneur, mon peuple me traite de menteur","translation_en":"He said, \"My Lord, indeed my people have denied me","transliteration":"Qala rabbi inna qawmee kaththabooni"},{"id":118,"text":"فَٱفۡتَحۡ بَيۡنِي وَبَيۡنَهُمۡ فَتۡحٗا وَنَجِّنِي وَمَن مَّعِيَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Tranche donc clairement entre eux et moi; et sauve-moi ainsi que ceux des croyants qui sont avec moi»","translation_en":"Then judge between me and them with decisive judgement and save me and those with me of the believers","transliteration":"Faiftah baynee wabaynahum fathan wanajjinee waman maAAiya mina almumineena"},{"id":119,"text":"فَأَنجَيۡنَٰهُ وَمَن مَّعَهُۥ فِي ٱلۡفُلۡكِ ٱلۡمَشۡحُونِ","translation_fr":"Nous le sauvâmes donc, de même que ceux qui étaient avec lui dans l'arche, pleinement chargée","translation_en":"So We saved him and those with him in the laden ship","transliteration":"Faanjaynahu waman maAAahu fee alfulki almashhooni"},{"id":120,"text":"ثُمَّ أَغۡرَقۡنَا بَعۡدُ ٱلۡبَاقِينَ","translation_fr":"Et ensuite nous noyâmes le reste (les infidèles)","translation_en":"Then We drowned thereafter the remaining ones","transliteration":"Thumma aghraqna baAAdu albaqeena"},{"id":121,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà bien là un signe. Cependant, la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":122,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et Ton Seigneur, c'est lui vraiment le Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":123,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ عَادٌ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","translation_fr":"Les 'Aad traitèrent de menteurs les Envoyés","translation_en":"Aad denied the messengers","transliteration":"Kaththabat AAadun almursaleena"},{"id":124,"text":"إِذۡ قَالَ لَهُمۡ أَخُوهُمۡ هُودٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ","translation_fr":"Et quand Hûd, leur frère (contribule), leur dit: «Ne craindrez-vous pas [Allah]?»","translation_en":"When their brother Hud said to them, \"Will you not fear Allah","transliteration":"Ith qala lahum akhoohum hoodun ala tattaqoona"},{"id":125,"text":"إِنِّي لَكُمۡ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٞ","translation_fr":"Je suis pour vous un messager digne de confiance","translation_en":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger","transliteration":"Innee lakum rasoolun ameenun"},{"id":126,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":127,"text":"وَمَآ أَسۡـَٔلُكُمۡ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۡ أَجۡرٍۖ إِنۡ أَجۡرِيَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Et je ne vous demande pas de salaire pour cela; mon salaire n'incombe qu'au Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Wama asalukum AAalayhi min ajrin in ajriya illa AAala rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":128,"text":"أَتَبۡنُونَ بِكُلِّ رِيعٍ ءَايَةٗ تَعۡبَثُونَ","translation_fr":"Bâtissez-vous par frivolité sur chaque colline un monument","translation_en":"Do you construct on every elevation a sign, amusing yourselves","transliteration":"Atabnoona bikulli reeAAin ayatan taAAbathoona"},{"id":129,"text":"وَتَتَّخِذُونَ مَصَانِعَ لَعَلَّكُمۡ تَخۡلُدُونَ","translation_fr":"Et édifiez-vous des châteaux comme si vous deviez demeurer éternellement","translation_en":"And take for yourselves palaces and fortresses that you might abide eternally","transliteration":"Watattakhithoona masaniAAa laAAallakum takhludoona"},{"id":130,"text":"وَإِذَا بَطَشۡتُم بَطَشۡتُمۡ جَبَّارِينَ","translation_fr":"Et quand vous sévissez contre quelqu'un, vous le faites impitoyablement","translation_en":"And when you strike, you strike as tyrants","transliteration":"Waitha batashtum batashtum jabbareena"},{"id":131,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":132,"text":"وَٱتَّقُواْ ٱلَّذِيٓ أَمَدَّكُم بِمَا تَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Craignez Celui qui vous a pourvus de [toutes les bonnes choses] que vous connaissez","translation_en":"And fear He who provided you with that which you know","transliteration":"Waittaqoo allathee amaddakum bima taAAlamoona"},{"id":133,"text":"أَمَدَّكُم بِأَنۡعَٰمٖ وَبَنِينَ","translation_fr":"qui vous a pourvus de bestiaux et d'enfants","translation_en":"Provided you with grazing livestock and children","transliteration":"Amaddakum bianAAamin wabaneena"},{"id":134,"text":"وَجَنَّـٰتٖ وَعُيُونٍ","translation_fr":"de jardins et de sources","translation_en":"And gardens and springs","transliteration":"Wajannatin waAAuyoonin"},{"id":135,"text":"إِنِّيٓ أَخَافُ عَلَيۡكُمۡ عَذَابَ يَوۡمٍ عَظِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Je crains pour vous le châtiment d'un Jour terrible»","translation_en":"Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a terrible day","transliteration":"Innee akhafu AAalaykum AAathaba yawmin AAatheemin"},{"id":136,"text":"قَالُواْ سَوَآءٌ عَلَيۡنَآ أَوَعَظۡتَ أَمۡ لَمۡ تَكُن مِّنَ ٱلۡوَٰعِظِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Que tu nous exhortes ou pas, cela nous est parfaitement égal","translation_en":"They said, \"It is all the same to us whether you advise or are not of the advisors","transliteration":"Qaloo sawaon AAalayna awaAAathta am lam takun mina alwaAAitheena"},{"id":137,"text":"إِنۡ هَٰذَآ إِلَّا خُلُقُ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"Ce ne sont là que des mours des anciens","translation_en":"This is not but the custom of the former peoples","transliteration":"In hatha illa khuluqu alawwaleena"},{"id":138,"text":"وَمَا نَحۡنُ بِمُعَذَّبِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous ne serons nullement châtiés»","translation_en":"And we are not to be punished","transliteration":"Wama nahnu bimuAAaththabeena"},{"id":139,"text":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَأَهۡلَكۡنَٰهُمۡۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils le traitèrent donc de menteur. Et nous les fîmes périr. Voilà bien là un signe! Cependant, la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"And they denied him, so We destroyed them. Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Fakaththaboohu faahlaknahum inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":140,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et Ton Seigneur, c'est Lui vraiment le Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":141,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ ثَمُودُ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","translation_fr":"Les Thamûd traitèrent de menteurs les Messagers","translation_en":"Thamud denied the messengers","transliteration":"Kaththabat thamoodu almursaleena"},{"id":142,"text":"إِذۡ قَالَ لَهُمۡ أَخُوهُمۡ صَٰلِحٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ","translation_fr":"Quand Sâlih, leur frère (contribule) leur dit: «Ne craindrez-vous pas [Allah]?»","translation_en":"When their brother Salih said to them, \"Will you not fear Allah","transliteration":"Ith qala lahum akhoohum salihun ala tattaqoona"},{"id":143,"text":"إِنِّي لَكُمۡ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٞ","translation_fr":"Je suis pour vous un messager digne de confiance","translation_en":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger","transliteration":"Innee lakum rasoolun ameenun"},{"id":144,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":145,"text":"وَمَآ أَسۡـَٔلُكُمۡ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۡ أَجۡرٍۖ إِنۡ أَجۡرِيَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Je ne vous demande pas de salaire pour cela, mon salaire n'incombe qu'au Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Wama asalukum AAalayhi min ajrin in ajriya illa AAala rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":146,"text":"أَتُتۡرَكُونَ فِي مَا هَٰهُنَآ ءَامِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Vous laissera-t-on en sécurité dans votre présente condition","translation_en":"Will you be left in what is here, secure [from death]","transliteration":"Atutrakoona fee ma hahuna amineena"},{"id":147,"text":"فِي جَنَّـٰتٖ وَعُيُونٖ","translation_fr":"Au milieu de jardins, de sources","translation_en":"Within gardens and springs","transliteration":"Fee jannatin waAAuyoonin"},{"id":148,"text":"وَزُرُوعٖ وَنَخۡلٖ طَلۡعُهَا هَضِيمٞ","translation_fr":"de cultures et de palmiers aux fruits digestes","translation_en":"And fields of crops and palm trees with softened fruit","transliteration":"WazurooAAin wanakhlin talAAuha hadeemun"},{"id":149,"text":"وَتَنۡحِتُونَ مِنَ ٱلۡجِبَالِ بُيُوتٗا فَٰرِهِينَ","translation_fr":"Creusez-vous habilement des maisons dans les montagnes","translation_en":"And you carve out of the mountains, homes, with skill","transliteration":"Watanhitoona mina aljibali buyootan fariheena"},{"id":150,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":151,"text":"وَلَا تُطِيعُوٓاْ أَمۡرَ ٱلۡمُسۡرِفِينَ","translation_fr":"N'obéissez pas à l'ordre des outranciers","translation_en":"And do not obey the order of the transgressors","transliteration":"Wala tuteeAAoo amra almusrifeena"},{"id":152,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُفۡسِدُونَ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَلَا يُصۡلِحُونَ","translation_fr":"qui sèment le désordre sur la terre et n'améliorent rien»","translation_en":"Who cause corruption in the land and do not amend","transliteration":"Allatheena yufsidoona fee alardi wala yuslihoona"},{"id":153,"text":"قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُسَحَّرِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Tu n'es qu'un ensorcelé","translation_en":"They said, \"You are only of those affected by magic","transliteration":"Qaloo innama anta mina almusahhareena"},{"id":154,"text":"مَآ أَنتَ إِلَّا بَشَرٞ مِّثۡلُنَا فَأۡتِ بِـَٔايَةٍ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","translation_fr":"Tu n'es qu'un homme comme nous. Apporte donc un prodige, si tu es du nombre des véridiques»","translation_en":"You are but a man like ourselves, so bring a sign, if you should be of the truthful","transliteration":"Ma anta illa basharun mithluna fati biayatin in kunta mina alssadiqeena"},{"id":155,"text":"قَالَ هَٰذِهِۦ نَاقَةٞ لَّهَا شِرۡبٞ وَلَكُمۡ شِرۡبُ يَوۡمٖ مَّعۡلُومٖ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Voici une chamelle: à elle de boire un jour convenu, et à vous de boire un jour","translation_en":"He said, \"This is a she-camel. For her is a [time of] drink, and for you is a [time of] drink, [each] on a known day","transliteration":"Qala hathihi naqatun laha shirbun walakum shirbu yawmin maAAloomin"},{"id":156,"text":"وَلَا تَمَسُّوهَا بِسُوٓءٖ فَيَأۡخُذَكُمۡ عَذَابُ يَوۡمٍ عَظِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Et ne lui infligez aucun mal, sinon le châtiment d'un jour terrible vous saisira»","translation_en":"And do not touch her with harm, lest you be seized by the punishment of a terrible day","transliteration":"Wala tamassooha bisooin fayakhuthakum AAathabu yawmin AAatheemin"},{"id":157,"text":"فَعَقَرُوهَا فَأَصۡبَحُواْ نَٰدِمِينَ","translation_fr":"Mais ils la tuèrent. Eh bien, ils eurent à regretter","translation_en":"But they hamstrung her and so became regretful","transliteration":"FaAAaqarooha faasbahoo nadimeena"},{"id":158,"text":"فَأَخَذَهُمُ ٱلۡعَذَابُۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Le châtiment, en effet, les saisit. Voilà bien là un prodige. Cependant, la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"And the punishment seized them. Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Faakhathahumu alAAathabu inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":159,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et ton Seigneur, c'est en vérité Lui le Tout Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":160,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ قَوۡمُ لُوطٍ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","translation_fr":"Le peuple de Lot traita de menteurs les Messagers","translation_en":"The people of Lot denied the messengers","transliteration":"Kaththabat qawmu lootin almursaleena"},{"id":161,"text":"إِذۡ قَالَ لَهُمۡ أَخُوهُمۡ لُوطٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ","translation_fr":"quand leur frère Lot leur dit: «Ne craindrez-vous pas [Allah]","translation_en":"When their brother Lot said to them, \"Will you not fear Allah","transliteration":"Ith qala lahum akhoohum lootun ala tattaqoona"},{"id":162,"text":"إِنِّي لَكُمۡ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٞ","translation_fr":"Je suis pour vous un messager digne de confiance","translation_en":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger","transliteration":"Innee lakum rasoolun ameenun"},{"id":163,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":164,"text":"وَمَآ أَسۡـَٔلُكُمۡ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۡ أَجۡرٍۖ إِنۡ أَجۡرِيَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Je ne vous demande pas de salaire pour cela; mon salaire n'incombe qu'au Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Wama asalukum AAalayhi min ajrin in ajriya illa AAala rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":165,"text":"أَتَأۡتُونَ ٱلذُّكۡرَانَ مِنَ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Accomplissez-vous l'acte charnel avec les mâles de ce monde","translation_en":"Do you approach males among the worlds","transliteration":"Atatoona alththukrana mina alAAalameena"},{"id":166,"text":"وَتَذَرُونَ مَا خَلَقَ لَكُمۡ رَبُّكُم مِّنۡ أَزۡوَٰجِكُمۚ بَلۡ أَنتُمۡ قَوۡمٌ عَادُونَ","translation_fr":"Et délaissez-vous les épouses que votre Seigneur a créées pour vous? Mais vous n'êtes que des gens transgresseurs»","translation_en":"And leave what your Lord has created for you as mates? But you are a people transgressing","transliteration":"Watatharoona ma khalaqa lakum rabbukum min azwajikum bal antum qawmun AAadoona"},{"id":167,"text":"قَالُواْ لَئِن لَّمۡ تَنتَهِ يَٰلُوطُ لَتَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلۡمُخۡرَجِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Si tu ne cesses pas, Lot, tu seras certainement du nombre des expulsés»","translation_en":"They said, \"If you do not desist, O Lot, you will surely be of those evicted","transliteration":"Qaloo lain lam tantahi ya lootu latakoonanna mina almukhrajeena"},{"id":168,"text":"قَالَ إِنِّي لِعَمَلِكُم مِّنَ ٱلۡقَالِينَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Je déteste vraiment ce que vous faites","translation_en":"He said, \"Indeed, I am, toward your deed, of those who detest [it]","transliteration":"Qala innee liAAamalikum mina alqaleena"},{"id":169,"text":"رَبِّ نَجِّنِي وَأَهۡلِي مِمَّا يَعۡمَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Seigneur, sauve-moi ainsi que ma famille de ce qu'ils font»","translation_en":"My Lord, save me and my family from [the consequence of] what they do","transliteration":"Rabbi najjinee waahlee mimma yaAAmaloona"},{"id":170,"text":"فَنَجَّيۡنَٰهُ وَأَهۡلَهُۥٓ أَجۡمَعِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous le sauvâmes alors, lui et toute sa famille","translation_en":"So We saved him and his family, all","transliteration":"Fanajjaynahu waahlahu ajmaAAeena"},{"id":171,"text":"إِلَّا عَجُوزٗا فِي ٱلۡغَٰبِرِينَ","translation_fr":"sauf une vieille qui fut parmi les exterminés","translation_en":"Except an old woman among those who remained behind","transliteration":"Illa AAajoozan fee alghabireena"},{"id":172,"text":"ثُمَّ دَمَّرۡنَا ٱلۡأٓخَرِينَ","translation_fr":"Puis Nous détruisîmes les autres","translation_en":"Then We destroyed the others","transliteration":"Thumma dammarna alakhareena"},{"id":173,"text":"وَأَمۡطَرۡنَا عَلَيۡهِم مَّطَرٗاۖ فَسَآءَ مَطَرُ ٱلۡمُنذَرِينَ","translation_fr":"et Nous fîmes pleuvoir sur eux une pluie (de pierres). Et quelle pluie fatale pour ceux qui sont avertis","translation_en":"And We rained upon them a rain [of stones], and evil was the rain of those who were warned","transliteration":"Waamtarna AAalayhim mataran fasaa mataru almunthareena"},{"id":174,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà bien là un prodige. Cependant, la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":175,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et ton Seigneur, c'est en vérité Lui le Tout Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":176,"text":"كَذَّبَ أَصۡحَٰبُ لۡـَٔيۡكَةِ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","translation_fr":"Les gens d'Al-Ayka traitèrent de menteurs les Messagers","translation_en":"The companions of the thicket denied the messengers","transliteration":"Kaththaba ashabu alaykati almursaleena"},{"id":177,"text":"إِذۡ قَالَ لَهُمۡ شُعَيۡبٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ","translation_fr":"Lorsque Chuayb leur dit: «Ne craindrez-vous pas [Allah]»","translation_en":"When Shu'ayb said to them, \"Will you not fear Allah","transliteration":"Ith qala lahum shuAAaybun ala tattaqoona"},{"id":178,"text":"إِنِّي لَكُمۡ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٞ","translation_fr":"Je suis pour vous un messager digne de confiance","translation_en":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger","transliteration":"Innee lakum rasoolun ameenun"},{"id":179,"text":"فَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Craignez Allah donc et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"So fear Allah and obey me","transliteration":"Faittaqoo Allaha waateeAAooni"},{"id":180,"text":"وَمَآ أَسۡـَٔلُكُمۡ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۡ أَجۡرٍۖ إِنۡ أَجۡرِيَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"et je ne vous demande pas de salaire pour cela; mon salaire n'incombe qu'au Seigneur de l'univers","translation_en":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Wama asalukum AAalayhi min ajrin in ajriya illa AAala rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":181,"text":"۞أَوۡفُواْ ٱلۡكَيۡلَ وَلَا تَكُونُواْ مِنَ ٱلۡمُخۡسِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Donnez la pleine mesure et n'en faites rien perdre [aux gens]","translation_en":"Give full measure and do not be of those who cause loss","transliteration":"Awfoo alkayla wala takoonoo mina almukhsireena"},{"id":182,"text":"وَزِنُواْ بِٱلۡقِسۡطَاسِ ٱلۡمُسۡتَقِيمِ","translation_fr":"et pesez avec une balance exacte","translation_en":"And weigh with an even balance","transliteration":"Wazinoo bialqistasi almustaqeemi"},{"id":183,"text":"وَلَا تَبۡخَسُواْ ٱلنَّاسَ أَشۡيَآءَهُمۡ وَلَا تَعۡثَوۡاْ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ مُفۡسِدِينَ","translation_fr":"Ne donnez pas aux gens moins que leur dû; et ne commettez pas de désordre et de corruption sur terre","translation_en":"And do not deprive people of their due and do not commit abuse on earth, spreading corruption","transliteration":"Wala tabkhasoo alnnasa ashyaahum wala taAAthaw fee alardi mufsideena"},{"id":184,"text":"وَٱتَّقُواْ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَكُمۡ وَٱلۡجِبِلَّةَ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"Et craignez Celui qui vous a créés, vous et les anciennes générations»","translation_en":"And fear He who created you and the former creation","transliteration":"Waittaqoo allathee khalaqakum waaljibillata alawwaleena"},{"id":185,"text":"قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُسَحَّرِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Tu es certes du nombre des ensorcelés","translation_en":"They said, \"You are only of those affected by magic","transliteration":"Qaloo innama anta mina almusahhareena"},{"id":186,"text":"وَمَآ أَنتَ إِلَّا بَشَرٞ مِّثۡلُنَا وَإِن نَّظُنُّكَ لَمِنَ ٱلۡكَٰذِبِينَ","translation_fr":"Tu n'es qu'un homme comme nous; et vraiment nous pensons que tu es du nombre des menteurs","translation_en":"You are but a man like ourselves, and indeed, we think you are among the liars","transliteration":"Wama anta illa basharun mithluna wain nathunnuka lamina alkathibeena"},{"id":187,"text":"فَأَسۡقِطۡ عَلَيۡنَا كِسَفٗا مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","translation_fr":"Fais donc tomber sur nous des morceaux du ciel si tu es du nombre des véridiques!»","translation_en":"So cause to fall upon us fragments of the sky, if you should be of the truthful","transliteration":"Faasqit AAalayna kisafan mina alssamai in kunta mina alssadiqeena"},{"id":188,"text":"قَالَ رَبِّيٓ أَعۡلَمُ بِمَا تَعۡمَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Mon Seigneur sait mieux ce que vous faites»","translation_en":"He said, \"My Lord is most knowing of what you do","transliteration":"Qala rabbee aAAlamu bima taAAmaloona"},{"id":189,"text":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَأَخَذَهُمۡ عَذَابُ يَوۡمِ ٱلظُّلَّةِۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ عَذَابَ يَوۡمٍ عَظِيمٍ","translation_fr":"Mais ils le traitèrent de menteur. Alors, le châtiment du jour de l'Ombre les saisit. Ce fut le châtiment d'un jour terrible","translation_en":"And they denied him, so the punishment of the day of the black cloud seized them. Indeed, it was the punishment of a terrible day","transliteration":"Fakaththaboohu faakhathahum AAathabu yawmi alththullati innahu kana AAathaba yawmin AAatheemin"},{"id":190,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà bien là un prodige. Cependant, la plupart d'entre eux ne croient pas","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatan wama kana aktharuhum mumineena"},{"id":191,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et ton Seigneur, c'est en vérité Lui le Tout Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka lahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":192,"text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَتَنزِيلُ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Ce (Coran) ci, c'est le Seigneur de l'univers qui l'a fait descendre","translation_en":"And indeed, the Qur'an is the revelation of the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Wainnahu latanzeelu rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":193,"text":"نَزَلَ بِهِ ٱلرُّوحُ ٱلۡأَمِينُ","translation_fr":"et l'Esprit fidèle est descendu avec cela","translation_en":"The Trustworthy Spirit has brought it down","transliteration":"Nazala bihi alrroohu alameenu"},{"id":194,"text":"عَلَىٰ قَلۡبِكَ لِتَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُنذِرِينَ","translation_fr":"sur ton cœur, pour que tu sois du nombre des avertisseurs","translation_en":"Upon your heart, [O Muhammad] - that you may be of the warners","transliteration":"AAala qalbika litakoona mina almunthireena"},{"id":195,"text":"بِلِسَانٍ عَرَبِيّٖ مُّبِينٖ","translation_fr":"en une langue arabe très claire","translation_en":"In a clear Arabic language","transliteration":"Bilisanin AAarabiyyin mubeenin"},{"id":196,"text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَفِي زُبُرِ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"Et ceci était déjà mentionné dans les Ecrits des anciens (envoyés)","translation_en":"And indeed, it is [mentioned] in the scriptures of former peoples","transliteration":"Wainnahu lafee zuburi alawwaleena"},{"id":197,"text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَكُن لَّهُمۡ ءَايَةً أَن يَعۡلَمَهُۥ عُلَمَـٰٓؤُاْ بَنِيٓ إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ","translation_fr":"N'est-ce pas pour eux un signe, que les savants des Enfants d'Israël le sachent","translation_en":"And has it not been a sign to them that it is recognized by the scholars of the Children of Israel","transliteration":"Awalam yakun lahum ayatan an yaAAlamahu AAulamao banee israeela"},{"id":198,"text":"وَلَوۡ نَزَّلۡنَٰهُ عَلَىٰ بَعۡضِ ٱلۡأَعۡجَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Si Nous l'avions fait descendre sur quelqu'un des non-Arabes","translation_en":"And even if We had revealed it to one among the foreigners","transliteration":"Walaw nazzalnahu AAala baAAdi alaAAjameena"},{"id":199,"text":"فَقَرَأَهُۥ عَلَيۡهِم مَّا كَانُواْ بِهِۦ مُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"et que celui-ci le leur eut récité, ils n'y auraient pas cru","translation_en":"And he had recited it to them [perfectly], they would [still] not have been believers in it","transliteration":"Faqaraahu AAalayhim ma kanoo bihi mumineena"},{"id":200,"text":"كَذَٰلِكَ سَلَكۡنَٰهُ فِي قُلُوبِ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ","translation_fr":"Ainsi l'avons Nous fait pénétrer [le doute] dans les cœurs des criminels","translation_en":"Thus have We inserted disbelief into the hearts of the criminals","transliteration":"Kathalika salaknahu fee quloobi almujrimeena"},{"id":201,"text":"لَا يُؤۡمِنُونَ بِهِۦ حَتَّىٰ يَرَوُاْ ٱلۡعَذَابَ ٱلۡأَلِيمَ","translation_fr":"mais ils n'y [le Coran] croiront pas avant de voir le châtiment douloureux","translation_en":"They will not believe in it until they see the painful punishment","transliteration":"La yuminoona bihi hatta yarawoo alAAathaba alaleema"},{"id":202,"text":"فَيَأۡتِيَهُم بَغۡتَةٗ وَهُمۡ لَا يَشۡعُرُونَ","translation_fr":"qui viendra sur eux soudain, sans qu'ils s'en rendent compte","translation_en":"And it will come to them suddenly while they perceive [it] not","transliteration":"Fayatiyahum baghtatan wahum la yashAAuroona"},{"id":203,"text":"فَيَقُولُواْ هَلۡ نَحۡنُ مُنظَرُونَ","translation_fr":"alors ils diront: «Est-ce qu'on va nous donner du répit?»","translation_en":"And they will say, \"May we be reprieved","transliteration":"Fayaqooloo hal nahnu muntharoona"},{"id":204,"text":"أَفَبِعَذَابِنَا يَسۡتَعۡجِلُونَ","translation_fr":"Est-ce qu'ils cherchent à hâter Notre châtiment","translation_en":"So for Our punishment are they impatient","transliteration":"AfabiAAathabina yastaAAjiloona"},{"id":205,"text":"أَفَرَءَيۡتَ إِن مَّتَّعۡنَٰهُمۡ سِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Vois-tu si Nous leur permettions de jouir, des années durant","translation_en":"Then have you considered if We gave them enjoyment for years","transliteration":"Afaraayta in mattaAAnahum sineena"},{"id":206,"text":"ثُمَّ جَآءَهُم مَّا كَانُواْ يُوعَدُونَ","translation_fr":"et qu'ensuite leur arrive ce dont on les menaçait","translation_en":"And then there came to them that which they were promised","transliteration":"Thumma jaahum ma kanoo yooAAadoona"},{"id":207,"text":"مَآ أَغۡنَىٰ عَنۡهُم مَّا كَانُواْ يُمَتَّعُونَ","translation_fr":"les jouissances qu'on leur a permises ne leur serviraient à rien","translation_en":"They would not be availed by the enjoyment with which they were provided","transliteration":"Ma aghna AAanhum ma kanoo yumattaAAoona"},{"id":208,"text":"وَمَآ أَهۡلَكۡنَا مِن قَرۡيَةٍ إِلَّا لَهَا مُنذِرُونَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous ne faisons pas périr de cité avant qu'elle n'ait eu des avertisseurs","translation_en":"And We did not destroy any city except that it had warners","transliteration":"Wama ahlakna min qaryatin illa laha munthiroona"},{"id":209,"text":"ذِكۡرَىٰ وَمَا كُنَّا ظَٰلِمِينَ","translation_fr":"[à titre de] rappel, et Nous ne sommes pas injuste","translation_en":"As a reminder; and never have We been unjust","transliteration":"Thikra wama kunna thalimeena"},{"id":210,"text":"وَمَا تَنَزَّلَتۡ بِهِ ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ","translation_fr":"Et ce ne sont point les diables qui sont descendus avec ceci (le Coran)","translation_en":"And the devils have not brought the revelation down","transliteration":"Wama tanazzalat bihi alshshayateenu"},{"id":211,"text":"وَمَا يَنۢبَغِي لَهُمۡ وَمَا يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ","translation_fr":"cela ne leur convient pas; et ils n'auraient pu le faire","translation_en":"It is not allowable for them, nor would they be able","transliteration":"Wama yanbaghee lahum wama yastateeAAoona"},{"id":212,"text":"إِنَّهُمۡ عَنِ ٱلسَّمۡعِ لَمَعۡزُولُونَ","translation_fr":"Car ils sont écartés de toute écoute (du message divin)","translation_en":"Indeed they, from [its] hearing, are removed","transliteration":"Innahum AAani alssamAAi lamaAAzooloona"},{"id":213,"text":"فَلَا تَدۡعُ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ إِلَٰهًا ءَاخَرَ فَتَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُعَذَّبِينَ","translation_fr":"N'invoque donc pas une autre divinité avec Allah, sinon tu seras du nombre des châtiés","translation_en":"So do not invoke with Allah another deity and [thus] be among the punished","transliteration":"Fala tadAAu maAAa Allahi ilahan akhara fatakoona mina almuAAaththabeena"},{"id":214,"text":"وَأَنذِرۡ عَشِيرَتَكَ ٱلۡأَقۡرَبِينَ","translation_fr":"Et avertis les gens qui te sont les plus proches","translation_en":"And warn, [O Muhammad], your closest kindred","transliteration":"Waanthir AAasheerataka alaqrabeena"},{"id":215,"text":"وَٱخۡفِضۡ جَنَاحَكَ لِمَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Et abaisse ton aile [sois bienveillant] pour les croyants qui te suivent","translation_en":"And lower your wing to those who follow you of the believers","transliteration":"Waikhfid janahaka limani ittabaAAaka mina almumineena"},{"id":216,"text":"فَإِنۡ عَصَوۡكَ فَقُلۡ إِنِّي بَرِيٓءٞ مِّمَّا تَعۡمَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Mais s'ils te désobéissent, dis-leur: «Moi, je désavoue ce que vous faites»","translation_en":"And if they disobey you, then say, \"Indeed, I am disassociated from what you are doing","transliteration":"Fain AAasawka faqul innee bareeon mimma taAAmaloona"},{"id":217,"text":"وَتَوَكَّلۡ عَلَى ٱلۡعَزِيزِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","translation_fr":"Et place ta confiance dans le Tout Puissant, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"And rely upon the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Watawakkal AAala alAAazeezi alrraheemi"},{"id":218,"text":"ٱلَّذِي يَرَىٰكَ حِينَ تَقُومُ","translation_fr":"qui te voit quand tu te lèves","translation_en":"Who sees you when you arise","transliteration":"Allathee yaraka heena taqoomu"},{"id":219,"text":"وَتَقَلُّبَكَ فِي ٱلسَّـٰجِدِينَ","translation_fr":"et (voit) tes gestes parmi ceux qui se prosternent","translation_en":"And your movement among those who prostrate","transliteration":"Wataqallubaka fee alssajideena"},{"id":220,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلۡعَلِيمُ","translation_fr":"C'est Lui vraiment, l'Audient, l'Omniscient","translation_en":"Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing","transliteration":"Innahu huwa alssameeAAu alAAaleemu"},{"id":221,"text":"هَلۡ أُنَبِّئُكُمۡ عَلَىٰ مَن تَنَزَّلُ ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ","translation_fr":"Vous apprendrai-Je sur qui les diables descendent","translation_en":"Shall I inform you upon whom the devils descend","transliteration":"Hal onabbiokum AAala man tanazzalu alshshayateenu"},{"id":222,"text":"تَنَزَّلُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ أَفَّاكٍ أَثِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Ils descendent sur tout calomniateur, pécheur","translation_en":"They descend upon every sinful liar","transliteration":"Tanazzalu AAala kulli affakin atheemin"},{"id":223,"text":"يُلۡقُونَ ٱلسَّمۡعَ وَأَكۡثَرُهُمۡ كَٰذِبُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils tendent l'oreille... Cependant, la plupart d'entre eux sont menteurs","translation_en":"They pass on what is heard, and most of them are liars","transliteration":"Yulqoona alssamAAa waaktharuhum kathiboona"},{"id":224,"text":"وَٱلشُّعَرَآءُ يَتَّبِعُهُمُ ٱلۡغَاوُۥنَ","translation_fr":"Et quant aux poètes, ce sont les égarés qui les suivent","translation_en":"And the poets - [only] the deviators follow them","transliteration":"WaalshshuAAarao yattabiAAuhumu alghawoona"},{"id":225,"text":"أَلَمۡ تَرَ أَنَّهُمۡ فِي كُلِّ وَادٖ يَهِيمُونَ","translation_fr":"Ne vois-tu pas qu'ils divaguent dans chaque vallée","translation_en":"Do you not see that in every valley they roam","transliteration":"Alam tara annahum fee kulli wadin yaheemoona"},{"id":226,"text":"وَأَنَّهُمۡ يَقُولُونَ مَا لَا يَفۡعَلُونَ","translation_fr":"et qu'ils disent ce qu'ils ne font pas","translation_en":"And that they say what they do not do","transliteration":"Waannahum yaqooloona ma la yafAAaloona"},{"id":227,"text":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ وَذَكَرُواْ ٱللَّهَ كَثِيرٗا وَٱنتَصَرُواْ مِنۢ بَعۡدِ مَا ظُلِمُواْۗ وَسَيَعۡلَمُ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوٓاْ أَيَّ مُنقَلَبٖ يَنقَلِبُونَ","translation_fr":"à part ceux qui croient et font de bonnes œuvres, qui invoquent souvent le nom d'Allah et se défendent contre les torts qu'on leur fait. Les injustes verront bientôt le revirement qu'ils [éprouveront]","translation_en":"Except those [poets] who believe and do righteous deeds and remember Allah often and defend [the Muslims] after they were wronged. And those who have wronged are going to know to what [kind of] return they will be returned","transliteration":"Illa allatheena amanoo waAAamiloo alssalihati wathakaroo Allaha katheeran waintasaroo min baAAdi ma thulimoo wasayaAAlamu allatheena thalamoo ayya munqalabin yanqaliboona"}]}